        <mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;Ch14 Exercises.pbix&lt;/b&gt;, the report saved with File &gt; Save as after Tutorial 14.3. Each exercise works in this copy, on a page or a DAX query view tab of its own, with its measures in a display folder of Key Measures." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F4;strokeColor=#5D6D7E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="180" width="860" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
