        <mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;i&gt;The model answer holds the 5 pages of the tutorials, a page for each of Ex 14.1 to Ex 14.4 and Notes; Exercises 14.5 and 14.6 are DAX query view tabs, Ex 14.5 and Control Totals, beside Tests and Checks. Exercise 14.2 is the only one that adds queries, and with them a second fact table.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="547" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
